config:
  layout: elk
---
flowchart TD
    A[Driver views schedule / 司机查看Schedule]
        --> B[Schedule shows shipment stops / 显示Shipment stops]

    B --> C[Start pickup / 开始提货]

    C --> D[Scan package barcode / 扫Package条码]

    D --> E[Find shipment_package by barcode / 根据barcode找到Package]
    E --> F[Find shipment by package.shipment_id / 回查Shipment]

    F --> G{Shipment belongs to this schedule? / Shipment是否属于当前Schedule}

    G -->|No| H[Reject scan / 拒绝扫描]
    H --> D

    G -->|Yes| I[Mark package picked up / Package标记已提货]

    I --> J[Update shipment pickup summary / 更新Shipment提货汇总]

    J --> K{More packages to scan? / 是否继续扫描}

    K -->|Yes| D
    K -->|No| L[Pickup verification / 提货校验]

    L --> M{All shipment packages picked up? / 所有Shipment是否完整提货}

    M -->|Yes| N[Start delivery / 开始派送]

    M -->|No| O[Show missing package list / 显示缺失Package列表]

    O --> P{Force start allowed? / 是否允许强制开始}

    P -->|No| D

    P -->|Yes| Q[Start delivery with pickup exception / 带提货异常开始]

    N --> R[Out for delivery / 派送中]
    Q --> R

    R --> S[Arrive at stop / 到达站点]

    S --> T[Open shipment stop / 打开Shipment stop]

    T --> U{Delivery action level / 派送操作粒度}

    U -->|Shipment-level confirm| V[Confirm shipment delivered / 整票确认送达]
    U -->|Package-level scan| W[Scan packages at delivery / 派送时逐件扫描]

    V --> X[Mark all picked-up packages delivered / 标记已提货Package为送达]

    W --> Y[Mark scanned packages delivered / 标记扫描Package送达]
    Y --> Z[Update shipment delivery summary / 更新Shipment派送汇总]

    X --> AA[Capture POD / 上传POD]
    Z --> AA

    AA --> AB{Shipment fully delivered? / Shipment是否完整送达}

    AB -->|Yes| AC[Shipment delivered / Shipment完成]
    AB -->|No| AD[Shipment partial delivered / Shipment部分完成或异常]

    AC --> AE{More stops? / 是否还有站点}
    AD --> AE

    AE -->|Yes| S
    AE -->|No| AF[Complete schedule / 完成Schedule]